WEBVTT

00:00:01.029 --> 00:00:04.824
Welcome, Harry, to diagon alley.

00:00:21.174 --> 00:00:23.676
Here, you get your quills and ink.

00:00:23.885 --> 00:00:27.847
Over there, all your bits and Bobs
for doing wizardry.

00:00:52.705 --> 00:00:54.916
Boy 1:
It's a world-class racing broom.

00:00:59.295 --> 00:01:02.590
Boy 2:
It's the fastest model yet.

00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:10.890
But how am I to pay for all this?
I haven't any money.

00:01:11.099 --> 00:01:14.435
There's your money.
Gringotts, the wizard bank.

00:01:14.686 --> 00:01:20.191
Ain't no safer place, not one.
Except perhaps Hogwarts.

00:01:32.829 --> 00:01:36.833
Hagrid, what exactly are these things?

00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:42.296
They're goblins. Clever as they come,
but not the most friendly of beasts.

00:01:42.463 --> 00:01:44.465
Best stay close.

00:01:48.469 --> 00:01:52.140
Mr. Harry Potter wishes
to make a withdrawal.

00:01:56.394 --> 00:01:59.564
And does Mr. Harry Potter
have his key?

00:02:00.481 --> 00:02:03.735
Wait a minute.
Got it here somewhere.

00:02:09.615 --> 00:02:12.493
And there's something else as well.

00:02:13.745 --> 00:02:17.081
Professor Dumbledore gave me this.

00:02:21.127 --> 00:02:26.174
It's about you-know-what
in vault you-know-which.

00:02:27.508 --> 00:02:29.469
Very well.

00:02:39.437 --> 00:02:41.689
Lamp, please.

00:02:50.198 --> 00:02:51.532
Key, please.

00:03:15.014 --> 00:03:18.726
Did you think your parents
would leave you with nothing?

00:03:20.061 --> 00:03:23.731
Goblin: Vault 713.
Harry: What's in there, Hagrid?

00:03:23.981 --> 00:03:28.152
Hagrid: Can't tell you.
Hogwarts business. Very secret.

00:03:28.402 --> 00:03:29.946
Goblin: Stand back.

00:03:58.224 --> 00:04:01.018
Best not to mention this to anyone.

00:04:09.443 --> 00:04:13.364
I still need a wand.

